Contains data from Asiaq, Greenland Survey, Technical Base Map (BYGNING), obtained 2026-10-31.
https://www.asiaq.gl/data-distribution/

Used under the Terms of Use for Asiaq Geodata:
https://www.asiaq.gl/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/EN_Terms_of_use_for_Asiaq_geodata.pdf
The terms grant worldwide free non-exclusive copying, distribution, publication, modification,
combination and commercial/noncommercial use, with the specified source credit, dataset name,
acquisition time, and terms made available to recipients. Asiaq must also appear on a service's
front page if other sources are named there. No endorsement is implied. Greenlandic law applies;
the data are as-is and Asiaq may change its terms.

OpenGeocoding selects building outlines with unambiguous B-numbers, derives interior points, transforms
GR96 / UTM to WGS84, and samples building-location queries. These are modified outputs, not
unmodified Asiaq publications. They are not GAR addresses, house-address or entrance ground truth.
